<title>UK: Boots up to record after Merrill upgrade.</title>
<headline>Boots up to record after Merrill upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Boots Co Plc climbed to a fresh record peak on Monday after brokerage Merrill Lynch upgraded its rating on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1257 GMT, the shares were up 7-1/2p to 691-1/2, just 1/2 off the record set earlier.  </p>
<p>Dealers said the brokerage raised its recommendation on the stock to &quot;accumulate&quot; from &quot;neutral.&quot;</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch's retail analyst was not immediately available to comment on his upgrade.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
